   "npc": "1938",
   "questID": 98298,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "It appears I get the last laugh after all, haha! Arugal truly was a fool. And I, Dalar Dawnweaver, have exposed him as the fraud he is.\r\n\r\nThese pieces are all the proof I need that the curse has nothing to do with that blithering dolt.\r\n\r\nRegrettably, that means his remedy is also worth nothing. It seems the search for a solution to the worgen curse continues.",
   "time": 1791383936,
